# Feature — Recurring Transaction

## Overview
Users can set up transactions that repeat automatically on a schedule.
Examples: monthly salary, Netflix subscription, rent, loan installment.
On app launch, check for due recurring transactions and auto-add them.

## Recurring Entity — recurring_transaction.dart
```dart
import 'package:freezed_annotation/freezed_annotation.dart';
part 'recurring_transaction.freezed.dart';

enum RecurringFrequency { daily, weekly, monthly, yearly }

@freezed
class RecurringTransaction with _$RecurringTransaction {
  const factory RecurringTransaction({
    required String id,
    required TransactionType type,
    required int amount,
    required String categoryId,
    required String walletId,
    required RecurringFrequency frequency,
    required int dayOfMonth,       // 1-31, used for monthly/yearly
    required DateTime startDate,
    DateTime? endDate,             // null = no end date
    DateTime? lastProcessedDate,   // last time this was auto-added
    required bool isActive,
    String? notes,
    required String label,         // e.g. "Netflix", "Gaji Bulanan"
    required DateTime createdAt,
  }) = _RecurringTransaction;
}
```

